<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Roadmap & Changelog | Psilocon Valley</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    {{template "nav-styles" .}}
    {{template "base-styles" .}}
    <style>
        .research-wrap {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 80px 24px 120px;
        }

        /* ── Thesis Hero — top of page ── */
        .thesis-hero {
            margin-bottom: 80px;
            padding-bottom: 80px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }

        .thesis-eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(74,222,128,0.8);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .thesis-eyebrow::before {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 24px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #4ade80;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .thesis-hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
            line-height: 1.0;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .thesis-hero h1 em {
            font-style: normal;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80 0%, #22d3ee 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .thesis-body {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 32px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .thesis-block {
            padding: 28px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .thesis-block::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 3px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4ade80, #22d3ee);
            border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
        }

        .thesis-block-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(74,222,128,0.6);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .thesis-block p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .thesis-block p strong {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* ── Roadmap Header ── */
        .roadmap-header {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        .roadmap-eyebrow {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .roadmap-header h2 {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .roadmap-header p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .roadmap-header p strong {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        }

        /* ── Section heads ── */
        .section-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            margin: 48px 0 20px;
        }

        .section-head::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }

        /* ── Cards ── */
        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        }

        /* Left accent bar per status */
        .card-shipped::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0; top: 0;
            width: 3px; height: 100%;
            background: #4ade80;
            border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
        }

        .card-building::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0; top: 0;
            width: 3px; height: 100%;
            background: #fbbf24;
            border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
        }

        .card-planned::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0; top: 0;
            width: 3px; height: 100%;
            background: #60a5fa;
            border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
        }

        .card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .card p strong {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        }

        /* ── Tags ── */
        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .tag-shipped {
            background: rgba(74,222,128,0.1);
            color: #4ade80;
            border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.2);
        }

        .tag-building {
            background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1);
            color: #fbbf24;
            border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.2);
        }

        .tag-planned {
            background: rgba(96,165,250,0.1);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2);
        }

        /* ── Meta ── */
        .meta {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .research-wrap { padding: 60px 20px 80px; }
            .thesis-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
            .thesis-hero h1 { letter-spacing: -2px; }
            .card { padding: 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

{{template "nav" .}}

<div class="research-wrap">

    <!-- ── Thesis Hero ── -->
    <div class="thesis-hero">
        <div class="thesis-eyebrow">The Thesis</div>
        <h1>The underground<br>network of<br><em>American business.</em></h1>

        <div class="thesis-body">
            <div class="thesis-block">
                <div class="thesis-block-label">The Name</div>
                <p>
                    Mycelium is the underground network of fungal threads that connects trees,
                    moves nutrients across a forest, and enables life above the surface.
                    It does <strong>invisible work that makes everything else possible.</strong>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="thesis-block">
                <div class="thesis-block-label">The Mission</div>
                <p>
                    <strong>That is exactly what blue collar business owners do.</strong>
                    Contractors, doctors, attorneys, landscapers — they are the underground network
                    of the American economy. The name is not an accident.
                    <strong>It is the thesis.</strong>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Roadmap ── -->
    <div class="roadmap-header">
        <div class="roadmap-eyebrow">Roadmap & Changelog</div>
        <h2>Everything we've built.<br>Everything we're building.</h2>
        <p>
            A living document. Updated with every release.
            <strong>No marketing. Just the work.</strong>
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Recently Shipped ── -->
    <div class="section-head">Recently Shipped</div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Bilingual Interface — English &amp; Spanish</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · Jun 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Full interface translation toggle. Dashboard, navigation, and labels
            render in English or Spanish based on user preference.
            <strong>Built for the 41 million Spanish speakers in America who run businesses.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.8 · Language saved to user profile</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Command Center Dashboard</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · Jun 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Redesigned dashboard with "Needs Attention" section — shows overdue invoices
            and pending estimates at a glance. No more digging through tables to find what matters.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.8 · Action-first design</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Expense Tracker</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · Jun 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Track business expenses by category. Dashboard shows total expenses,
            revenue, and net profit side by side.
            <strong>Know your numbers. Own your business.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.9 · Integrated with dashboard P&amp;L</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Estimates with Client Approval Flow</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Full estimate creation, client response flow (Accept / Decline / Suggest Changes),
            and one-click conversion from accepted estimate to draft invoice.
            <strong>The complete quote-to-cash pipeline.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.5 · Public client response route · No login required</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Stripe Connect — Client Card Payments</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Business owners connect their Stripe account and clients pay invoices
            directly by card. Money goes straight to the business owner.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.3 · OAuth flow · Direct payouts</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Recurring Invoice Automation</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Set up recurring schedules — weekly, monthly, or custom intervals.
            The system generates and optionally emails invoices automatically.
            <strong>Set it once. Get paid forever.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.1 · Background scheduler engine</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-shipped">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Enterprise-Grade Security</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · Jun 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Argon2id password hashing, HMAC-SHA256 signed sessions, HSTS preloading,
            Content Security Policy, rate limiting, and account lockout.
            <strong>Built for businesses that handle sensitive client data.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.9 · See /security for full overview</div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Building Now ── -->
    <div class="section-head">Building Now</div>

    <div class="card card-building">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Audit Logging</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-building">In Progress</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Every action logged — who accessed what, when, from where.
            Foundation for HIPAA compliance and enterprise trust.
            <strong>Required for medical offices and law firms.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Target: v4.0 · Migration 011</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-building">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Additional Languages</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-building">In Progress</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Hindi, Punjabi, Mandarin, Cantonese, and Vietnamese translations
            are in development. The engine is built — we are expanding the vocabulary.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Target: v4.0</div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── On The Horizon ── -->
    <div class="section-head">On The Horizon</div>

    <div class="card card-planned">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Team Seats &amp; Role-Based Access</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-planned">Planned</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Multi-user accounts for small teams — office managers, doctors, associates.
            Role controls so the right people see the right data.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Studio tier · Enterprise unlock</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-planned">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>HIPAA Business Associate Agreement</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-planned">Planned</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Formal BAA for medical practices. Combined with audit logging, session timeout,
            and encryption at rest — full HIPAA compliance for patient billing.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Enterprise tier · Legal review required</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-planned">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Borderless Payment Instructions</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-planned">Planned</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Better defaults for international invoicing — Wise, ACH, SWIFT instructions
            with multi-currency presentation and clearer payment terms on PDFs.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Discovery phase</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-planned">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Estimate Expiry Dates</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-planned">Planned</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Set a validity period on estimates. After expiry, the client sees
            "This estimate has expired" and must request a new one.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Design phase</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-planned">
        <div class="card-top">
            <h2>Stablecoin Payment References</h2>
            <span class="tag tag-planned">Planned</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            Manual crypto payment instructions on invoices — wallet address,
            memo/reference, and optional tx hash confirmation.
            No custody. No wallets. Just instructions.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Research phase</div>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>
        Built with Go + PostgreSQL —
        <a href="/research">Research</a> ·
        <a href="/tools">Tools</a> ·
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
    </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
